+    # ------------------------------------------------------------------
+    # BT_DSA_CACHE_CLEAR_MB (env-gated probe, default OFF)
+    #
+    # One-shot DSA compile-cache clear for the slot-corruption hunt
+    # (LPS-1062, gauss/cauchy). When the current microbatch index is in the
+    # comma-separated env list, clear every cuDNN DSA compile cache before
+    # the forward, forcing a fresh recompile for this slot. Corruption
+    # unchanged after a fresh compile => caches exonerated empirically;
+    # changed/vanished => the cached plan was the defect site.
+    # One recompile per cleared slot costs minutes - clear only the target.
+    # ------------------------------------------------------------------
